>> Combination := Dhaptar anyar.

Combination nalika: ['tambah-ing-mburi:'] tindakna: { :el
	dhiri 
	golek: el, Kosong? bener: { dhiri tambah-ing-mburi: el. }.
}.

>> colours := Combination anyar.
colours
	tambah-ing-mburi: ['red'],
	tambah-ing-mburi: ['green'],
	tambah-ing-mburi: ['blue'],
	tambah-ing-mburi: ['red'].

Wetonan tulis: colours, baris-anyar.
